5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious about the ground. It feels important to know what is under our feet before we start.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Hello everyone. I am here to look at the numbers. I want to see what this will cost us later.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, dear. I have seen many plans come and go. I want to see what remains.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am thinking about who will actually do the work. The staff numbers seem low to me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let us not guess. We need data on how people actually use this space right now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, do you have any specific figures in mind? I am just trying to understand the scope.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, I am looking at the long-term maintenance. The initial price is never the whole story.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with May. Pretty pictures fade. I want to see the history of our past projects.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, do you have any ideas on where to start looking for usage data?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, I am checking the traffic counts. We need to know where the people walk.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I am also worried about the companies. Are there enough of them to do the job?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the upkeep records. That is where the real money goes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will check the condition of the works from the earlier programme. It tells the truth.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the groundskeeping roll. I need to know who is on the payroll.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the drainage callouts. The ground tells us what it can handle.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will look at the regional firms tendering. I want to know who is available.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I will also look at the terms of the regional habitat fund. It might limit our options.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the record of the eastern avenue planting. It is a good example.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will also look at the volunteer groups. They might help fill the gaps.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also look at the timed counts of weekday crossings. It is crucial.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
