60,3,1,talk,Minato,,Candidate A is dense trees. That sounds like the avenue problem. I am worried.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,Candidate B is a paved square. That fits the fund limits and is cheaper to keep.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Candidate C is sports. That is hard surface. It might be durable, but is it a park?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Candidate D is wetlands. That needs specialist care. We don't have the staff for that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Candidate B fits the crossing data. People want firm ground. It is practical.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, I agree with you on B. The earth-moving risk is high for A and D.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, yes. B is the only one that doesn't break the fund terms or the budget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, I like that B is simple. It won't die like the trees did.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, B is manageable. We can use the volunteers for events, not daily maintenance.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, exactly. B respects the way people actually use the space.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minato,,I am voting for B. It is the safest choice for the ground and the schedule.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,I am voting for B. It is the only one that makes financial sense long-term.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am voting for B. It is honest and durable. I have seen enough of fragile plans.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I am voting for B. It is the only one we can actually staff and maintain.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am voting for B. It aligns with the user data and the site constraints.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minato,,I think we are all in agreement. B is the clear winner.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,May,,"Yes, the numbers don't lie. B is the responsible choice.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we chose something that will last. Thank you all.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Victoria,,It is a practical decision. I am satisfied with the outcome.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let us move forward. B is the plan.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
